# N4 (SOFT): the timed smoke of the combined best on c2-packed-tp4-best (audits off, the K/V slide, the quad on live banks, the fused
# commit in place, all five verify levers). An all-four reset, then a warmup, one coding stream and the steady four-stream test
# (concurrent4_steady). The product is the round timing: the live-4 round, the verify span, the commit phase, per-user decode rate
# and the [ACCEPT] mean, against tp4/stack-fix's speed window (verify 63.3 ms, four serial commits 37.9 ms, round 170 ms at two
# ramp users) and the vglue projection (a live-4 round of about 111 ms, about 46 tok/s per user at tau 5.1). Nothing combined has
# run on a card: every saving quoted is an estimate.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; the first engine build 10-30 min; the three tests 8-15 min: 20 / 35 / 90 min (a collective hang
# runs the 80-min ready loop, then the reset).
# SOFT: its product is data. A run whose levers fell back measures less than the profile says: read the markers first.
# Read: the ready line; the launched-argv line (profile c2-packed-tp4-best); no attach refusal; the vglue and fused-commit engaged
# lines and every fell-back line; [PACKED-PHASE] and [PACKED-PUBLISH] per round, medians at 4 live; readback_ms; the coding
# decode_tok_s; the concurrent4_steady per-user decode_tok_s and the [ACCEPT] mean.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_steady
